WEBVTT

00:01:46.790 --> 00:01:48.460
Keichou Year 6 (1601 AD)...

00:01:49.330 --> 00:01:54.090
Iwamoto Kogan is said to be unrivaled in the Noubi area.

00:02:15.900 --> 00:02:19.700
His right hand had one more finger than an ordinary one...

00:02:19.700 --> 00:02:24.450
...and Matsudaira Sadakatsu, the lord of Kakegawa, said...

00:02:26.410 --> 00:02:30.460
The Kogan Style Secret Swordplay Technique, Nagareboshi...

00:02:33.790 --> 00:02:37.840
Its mysteriousness... is unequaled in all of history...

00:02:41.390 --> 00:02:48.730
<b>The heads of two out of six criminals Kogan tested the sword on,
still remained atop their bodies, even after being cut. - Swordplay Style Founders Record</b>

00:02:49.390 --> 00:02:51.310
<b>Chapter Two: The Yodare-Azuki Ceremony</b>

00:02:51.310 --> 00:02:55.270
Ichijiku, ninjin, sansho, shiitake.
<b>Chapter Two: The Yodare-Azuki Ceremony</b>

00:02:55.270 --> 00:02:58.320
Ichijiku, ninjin, sansho, shiitake.

00:02:59.070 --> 00:03:05.580
Gobou, mukuroju, nanakusa, hatsutake.

00:03:08.200 --> 00:03:15.090
Ichijiku, ninjin, sansho, shiitake.

00:03:15.960 --> 00:03:22.340
Gobou, mukuroju, nanakusa, hatsutake.

00:03:23.300 --> 00:03:26.680
Kyuuri, tougan.

00:03:27.720 --> 00:03:34.520
Ichijiku, ninjin, sansho, shiitake.

00:03:35.310 --> 00:03:41.860
Gobou, mukuroju, nanakusa, hatsutake.

00:03:41.860 --> 00:03:45.320
Kyuuri, tougan.

00:03:46.530 --> 00:03:52.870
Ichijiku, ninjin, sansho, shiitake.

00:03:54.080 --> 00:04:00.460
Gobou, mukuroju, nanakusa, hatsutake.

00:04:01.260 --> 00:04:03.880
Kyuuri, tougan.

00:04:17.480 --> 00:04:19.070
Shall I do it for you?

00:04:32.080 --> 00:04:33.290
Please don't worry about me.

00:04:34.000 --> 00:04:36.580
This can be also training for my fingers.

00:05:18.380 --> 00:05:21.300
How was Fujiki?

00:05:23.920 --> 00:05:25.840
I guess it can't be helped...

00:05:26.430 --> 00:05:29.300
...since he lost clumsily like
that against a challenger to our dojo...

00:05:29.300 --> 00:05:33.140
...even though it was part of training.

00:05:55.700 --> 00:05:58.710
He doesn't open up even to Mie-dono's call.

00:05:59.250 --> 00:06:03.630
He probably won't feel up to learning, reading and writing today.

00:06:03.630 --> 00:06:06.090
And though it may just be my imagination, but Mie-dono, too...

00:06:06.090 --> 00:06:08.260
...has been acting strange since then.

00:06:09.090 --> 00:06:11.510
Be careful about what you say.

00:06:12.100 --> 00:06:15.470
At any rate, that Irako guy...

00:06:15.930 --> 00:06:18.600
His skills and attitude...

00:06:18.600 --> 00:06:20.810
He is hard to deal with.

00:06:22.440 --> 00:06:25.730
I hope we didn't bring trouble upon ourselves...

00:06:26.150 --> 00:06:28.360
He is a fool anyway.

00:07:15.080 --> 00:07:18.540
Like I thought... That jump isn't ordinary...

00:07:22.420 --> 00:07:23.920
He can read the distance to the opponent, too...

00:07:27.800 --> 00:07:30.470
I've seen through your swordsmanship.

00:07:30.470 --> 00:07:35.050
I think quitting now can also be considered a samurai's integrity.

00:07:38.180 --> 00:07:40.180
What do you think, Ushimata-dono?

00:07:45.650 --> 00:07:48.070
Yamauchi, Ootsubo...

00:07:48.070 --> 00:07:49.400
Block the exit.

00:07:52.200 --> 00:07:55.200
Instructor Ushimata has finished his warm up.

00:07:56.120 --> 00:07:56.830
Excuse me.

00:08:08.960 --> 00:08:12.050
Although I haven't mastered it all the way...

00:08:12.050 --> 00:08:14.970
...I will show you the Kogan Style.

00:08:47.630 --> 00:08:50.500
His smile... is gone.

00:08:59.010 --> 00:09:01.060
Killing is easy...

00:09:01.890 --> 00:09:04.230
Giving him a new look is hard...

00:09:26.170 --> 00:09:30.750
I have finally... come to encounter real swordsmanship.

00:09:31.590 --> 00:09:35.340
I now regret those days of being a rogue...

00:09:38.760 --> 00:09:44.310
I would like to ask you for permission
to become a pupil here from now on...

00:09:54.610 --> 00:09:58.360
A dojo is not the place to put on a show.

00:09:59.450 --> 00:10:02.910
He made Instructor Ushimata angry...

00:10:02.910 --> 00:10:06.910
Violating our hallowed dojo by putting on a charade...

00:10:10.250 --> 00:10:11.130
My...

00:10:12.130 --> 00:10:14.170
My sword!

00:10:15.920 --> 00:10:16.800
Out of my way!

00:10:16.800 --> 00:10:18.630
It's my sword!

00:10:18.630 --> 00:10:22.510
Matches against swordsmen
with another style are part of training.

00:10:22.970 --> 00:10:25.560
It's not a life or death fight.

00:10:52.790 --> 00:10:55.840
That bastard has natural talent.

00:10:55.840 --> 00:10:56.960
No.

00:10:56.960 --> 00:10:59.720
He's just a coward.

00:11:02.470 --> 00:11:03.800
Bring me a spear.

00:11:10.600 --> 00:11:12.060
How's he doing?

00:11:12.060 --> 00:11:15.730
Yes. He said he wouldn't eat until his request is granted...

00:11:15.730 --> 00:11:18.570
Hmm... What a stubborn guy.

00:11:19.700 --> 00:11:23.530
He really is hard to deal with.

00:11:54.650 --> 00:11:56.070
Ushimata-dono...

00:11:56.860 --> 00:12:02.200
I'm sorry, my lady, but I'd like you to leave.

00:12:02.200 --> 00:12:04.910
I came because Master asked me to come.

00:12:04.910 --> 00:12:08.950
You won't be able to see him today.

00:12:08.950 --> 00:12:10.450
I'm sorry.

00:12:34.230 --> 00:12:35.980
The size of the house...

00:12:38.190 --> 00:12:40.190
The number of servants...

00:12:45.530 --> 00:12:47.830
As to be expected of the house...

00:12:47.830 --> 00:12:49.790
...of a famous martial arts instructor in Kakegawa Domain.

00:12:51.000 --> 00:12:52.870
At least 300 koku...

00:13:04.260 --> 00:13:07.140
The only daughter of Kogan Iwamoto...

00:14:24.510 --> 00:14:25.960
Mosuke, is that you?

00:14:25.960 --> 00:14:26.920
Yes.

00:14:30.340 --> 00:14:32.390
It's ready.

00:14:46.030 --> 00:14:50.860
I used thick malt syrup in addition to the kuzuan sweet sauce.

00:14:50.860 --> 00:14:52.450
Please check.

00:15:11.140 --> 00:15:13.220
This stickiness will do.

00:15:30.530 --> 00:15:33.820
If I marry into the family, I'll be Kogan's successor.

00:15:33.820 --> 00:15:36.370
A Kakegawa retainer worth 300 koku...

00:15:38.580 --> 00:15:40.540
That doesn't sound too bad.

00:15:47.710 --> 00:15:50.550
Oh! Ushimata-dono!

00:15:54.050 --> 00:15:56.310
Irako Seigen...

00:15:56.310 --> 00:15:59.060
Sensei will see you.

00:15:59.060 --> 00:16:01.140
I really appreciate it!

00:16:01.140 --> 00:16:04.560
Then, my request to be his pupil was granted?

00:16:05.310 --> 00:16:08.570
Sensei will decide on that.

00:16:11.950 --> 00:16:15.580
So, I can finally meet Iwamoto Kogan.

00:16:16.450 --> 00:16:18.870
He fought face to face with Yagyu Munenori in the past.

00:16:18.870 --> 00:16:22.870
And he might've become the swordplay
instructor to the Shogun family if times hadn't changed.

00:16:22.870 --> 00:16:24.580
He is a rare master swordsman.

00:16:45.600 --> 00:16:47.730
He holds the sword differently.

00:16:47.730 --> 00:16:50.110
He's fast and in addition, his reach stretches...

00:16:50.110 --> 00:16:52.400
It's dangerous to step into that range.

00:16:53.400 --> 00:16:54.360
Then...

00:16:56.910 --> 00:17:00.660
Yagyu Shinkage Style, Juumonji!

00:17:02.750 --> 00:17:04.870
I see...

00:17:12.460 --> 00:17:15.880
Kogan Style, Nagareboshi!

00:17:29.570 --> 00:17:31.280
I shouldn't...

00:17:31.280 --> 00:17:33.900
I shouldn't fight any longer.

00:17:33.900 --> 00:17:36.530
I stand no chance to defeat this man...

00:17:36.530 --> 00:17:38.870
...even with my certain victory technique...

00:17:46.620 --> 00:17:48.580
I... I give...

00:17:48.580 --> 00:17:50.880
It's a draw.

00:18:06.890 --> 00:18:09.810
I will recommend you to the Tokugawa family.

00:18:09.810 --> 00:18:12.900
I judged that your skills are worthy of it.

00:18:15.740 --> 00:18:17.740
I am thankful.

00:18:23.830 --> 00:18:25.040
However...

00:18:28.620 --> 00:18:30.420
You want to be hired by us?

00:18:32.170 --> 00:18:34.380
Why are you hiding one of your fingers?

00:18:37.840 --> 00:18:39.680
Since it's displeasing...

00:18:41.600 --> 00:18:43.060
That's an insult.

00:18:46.640 --> 00:18:51.690
His Highness Taikou has the same number of fingers as you.

00:18:51.690 --> 00:18:54.110
Are you saying that's displeasing?

00:18:55.780 --> 00:18:59.320
It was Yagyu Munenori who advised him...

00:18:59.320 --> 00:19:01.820
...to hide his extra finger at the time of the audience.

00:19:02.780 --> 00:19:07.200
It was out of ambition that Kogan asked Munenori
to act as a go-between in exchange for saving his face...

00:19:07.200 --> 00:19:10.790
And that ambition was crushed by Munenori's cunning.

00:19:10.790 --> 00:19:11.500
It was Bunroku Year 4 (1595 AD).

00:19:11.500 --> 00:19:13.210
<b>The obsessed swordsman shed tears of vexation
It was Bunroku Year 4 (1595 AD).</b>

00:19:13.210 --> 00:19:14.840
<b>The obsessed swordsman shed tears of vexation</b>

00:19:39.610 --> 00:19:41.030
Ushimata-dono...

00:19:41.530 --> 00:19:46.370
Being tied like this, I can not show Sensei every courtesy.

00:19:47.040 --> 00:19:49.410
Do not lower your head.

00:19:49.410 --> 00:19:53.040
Just look straight and steadily at Sensei.

00:19:53.630 --> 00:19:55.960
Don't even move.

00:20:11.020 --> 00:20:14.270
What kind of charm is this?

00:20:26.410 --> 00:20:28.370
Sensei will appear now.

00:20:48.180 --> 00:20:49.470
Ushimata-dono!

00:20:52.560 --> 00:20:53.350
Wha...

00:21:04.410 --> 00:21:06.740
It's not Iku-sama.

00:21:06.740 --> 00:21:10.790
This is someone who wants to be your pupil.

00:21:28.550 --> 00:21:29.680
Magnificent!

00:21:29.680 --> 00:21:31.180
That's magnificent!

00:21:31.180 --> 00:21:34.560
That's magnificent...

00:21:34.560 --> 00:21:37.230
The Yodare-Azuki Bean Ceremony,
a ceremony for the commencement...

00:21:37.230 --> 00:21:38.940
...of training in the Kogan Style.

00:21:57.880 --> 00:22:04.970
People are not sure when Iwamoto
Kogan started falling into a demented state.

00:22:09.510 --> 00:22:14.980
<b>End: The Yodare-Azuki Ceremony</b>

00:23:44.980 --> 00:23:49.820
<b>Next Chapter: Kamaitachi</b>
